# Recreate container routing

When the user asks to recreate, regenerate, rebuild, or restart the Docker
container for this project (including Spanish phrasing such as "regenera
container", "recrea el container", "reconstruye el contenedor", or English
phrases like "recreate container", "regenerate container", "rebuild docker"),
**read and follow** `.cursor/skills/recreate-container/SKILL.md` before acting.

Do not improvise a different Compose workflow unless the user explicitly asks
for a variant listed in that skill (build-only, restart-only, wipe volumes).
